===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|+|ischemiae}} {{lb|en|American spelling}}

# {{lb|en|cardiology|pathology}} [[local#Adjective|Local]] [[disturbance]] in [[blood#Noun|blood]] [[circulation]] due to [[mechanical#Adjective|mechanical]] [[obstruction]] of the [[blood supply]] (for example, [[embolism]], [[thrombosis]], or [[vasoconstriction]]).

